  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On a late-night talk show, Kuroki impresses a celebrated host and television Editor producers with her sharp metaphor comparing media censorship to hiding inconvenient truths, earning talk of a regular slot. Listen for \"hiyu\", a metaphor.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "恥の感覚について詳しく聞きたいんだけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "身にまとった恥を捨てることが重要なんでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "報道機関が都合の悪い部分をモザイクで隠しているほうが問題です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "それはすばらしい比喩だと思うなあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "いえ、とんでもございません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "黒木さん、あなたテレビいいですよ。レギュラー考えますからね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。失礼いたします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "村西さん、この黒木香という女性はすごいね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうですか。引きつづきよろしくお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "疲れたな。お疲れさまでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君は何が食べたい？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "じゃあ私もお肉で。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "恥の感覚について詳しく聞きたいんだけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would like to hear in detail about your sense of shame.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "身にまとった恥を捨てることが重要なんでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Casting off the shame draped around oneself is what truly matters.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "報道機関が都合の悪い部分をモザイクで隠しているほうが問題です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Media outlets hiding inconvenient truths behind pixelation is a bigger problem.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "それはすばらしい比喩だと思うなあ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think that is a magnificent metaphor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "いえ、とんでもございません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh no, you flatter me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "黒木さん、あなたテレビいいですよ。レギュラー考えますからね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ms. Kuroki, you are fantastic on television. We will consider making you a regular.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。失礼いたします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much. Excuse me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "村西さん、この黒木香という女性はすごいね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Muranishi, this woman Kaoru Kuroki is truly remarkable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうですか。引きつづきよろしくお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that right? We appreciate your continued support.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "疲れたな。お疲れさまでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a tiring day. Great work tonight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君は何が食べたい？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you feel like eating?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "じゃあ私もお肉で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I will have steak too.'",
      "gap": 0.65
